{"page":20164,"part":1,"text":"　　 第六　平法\n\n　　 偃 首抢下，尾抢上。\n\n　　 仰 首抢上，尾抢下。\n\n　　 平 首抢平，尾抢平。\n\n　　 勒 上平中仰下偃，空中远抢，以杀其力，如勒马之用缰也。凡尾提处，观其笔燥湿何如。燥则驻蹲捺而实抢以补之，其次蹲而不捺，其次驻而不蹲，其次提而不驻即实抢之。湿则提起即空抢可也。\n\n　　 凡平画忌如算子；终篇展玩，不见横画，始是书法。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20164,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"8c7a04cc246950a16bd2e1946a3355feaa33686f84ffc787005e9a72cec98d09","textSha256":"8c7a04cc246950a16bd2e1946a3355feaa33686f84ffc787005e9a72cec98d09","fileSha256":"8c7a04cc246950a16bd2e1946a3355feaa33686f84ffc787005e9a72cec98d09","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20164-work-127.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"翰林要诀 · 第六 平法","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":8,"sourceTextSha256":"771b46ec2fda743716211ab0fd80686ba66e4deeb645aee15501c21bd9d3af3c","id":"word-翰林要诀-56","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"平法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":8},{"start":10,"end":23,"sourceTextSha256":"9fc57a1e3e66406c256cc0dae60417a573d82d3b1db753cdc9b0ee44eb05da9f","id":"word-翰林要诀-57","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"平法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":13},{"start":25,"end":38,"sourceTextSha256":"cb41ba663cbb4489bd30868ed4fcbf3d75c59964d33ff133a2e86179b6d3db19","id":"word-翰林要诀-58","page_id":"attachment:翰林要诀.docx","work":"翰林要诀","author":"陈绎曾","type":"text","chapterHint":"平法","root_id":"4JuVN7mkqoqQ3sCHF1StYc","origin":"wolai-word","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":13},{"start":40,"end":53,"sourceTextSha256":"9a4bcae09009f78f8d4f328a22e487f4661d5daeeb24fb7f1855ca8715d0ed92","id":"word-翰林要诀-59","page_